# Frontend (Vite) — copy to .env and fill in (never commit .env)
#
# SECURITY:
# - Use VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY only (RLS-protected public key).
# - NEVER set VITE_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY or any service-role secret here.
# - For local dev without direct Supabase reads, leave URL/key empty and use VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
